Double porches wrap the front of the house. Inside, heart-of-the-home spaces flow together: hardwood floors, a brick fireplace in the living room, and a kitchen built for crowds with a long center island, double ovens and a farmhouse sink. A screened porch off the back looks straight over the pool to the barn.

Five bedrooms and four and a half baths give the house real flexibility. Four bedrooms share the second floor, including the primary suite with its spa shower and double vanity. The third floor is a world of its own, with a fifth bedroom, a private bath, a kitchenette and a large media or living room, ideal for guests, teenagers or an in-law arrangement.

Outside, a travertine pool deck surrounds the saltwater pool and its fountain, a rear deck holds an outdoor fireplace, and past the lawn a three-stall barn with a center aisle is ready for horses or anything else you can dream up.', 'Bethel Properties', '', 'rewinddesigns31@gmail.com', 260000000, false,
